  << /ActualText (Patch is \034everything local\035\054 informing readers about \nwhat\047s going on nearby\056 While known for quality \nlocal content\054 the lack of focus on UX over the \nyears\054 paired with Patch\031s heavy reliance on \nincome from ads and sponsors\054 had caused the \nsite\031s usability to suffer\056)
