1216 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I was hired to redesign the Patch app and website \nto be more modern and user\055friendly\056 Patch \nwanted to attract a larger\054 more diverse audience \nand increase advertising profits through more \nbusiness link clicks and display\055ad views\056 )
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 1217 0 R
     /Pg 1198 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
