1218 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The first page we tackled was the local homepage\056 \nWe began with a whiteboarding session that \nincluded a Product Manager\054 UX researcher\054 front\055\nend developer\054 and me\054 the Senior Product \nDesigner\056 This enabled us to rapidly align our goals\054 \nideas\054 and requirements\056)
     /K [ 10 ]
     /P 1219 0 R
     /Pg 1198 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
