1260 0 obj
  << /ActualText (With the reader\055facing home page design in place\054 I moved on to the editors\031 \ninterface\056 This is where editors modified the homepage for their associated \nPatch \050community\051\056 Each section on the page acted as a separate component\054 \nmost of which were customizable by the editor\056 After interviewing editors and \ngathering feedback\054 I designed an interface that included only the editable \ncomponents\054 the ability to save by section or as a whole\054 and the option to \npreview the page at any time\056)
     /K [ 31 ]
     /P 1261 0 R
     /Pg 1198 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
